# LRS Benchmarking — Project Map & Navigation Guide

> **Goal:** make the repository easy to navigate without memorizing long paths, while keeping working Snakemake workflows stable.

---

## Visual legend

Use these colors as a fast mental code throughout the project:

| Color | Meaning | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| 🟦 **Navigation / project root** | High-level locations | `LRS`, `ASM`, `ALIGN` |
| 🟩 **Active workflow** | Files currently used for real workflow development | `Snakefile.assemblers` |
| 🟨 **Configuration** | Parameters and workflow configuration | `config.assemblers.yaml`, `containers.yaml` |
| 🟪 **Software environments** | Containers / Docker / Conda | `containers/`, `envs/` |
