# 13. Safe Git workflow

Because this repository contains several projects at the same time:

## Avoid

```bash
git add .
```

## Prefer

```bash
git add exact/path/to/file
```

Then always inspect:

```bash
git diff --cached
```

For assembler-only status:

```bash
lrs-asm-status
```

Mental rule:

```text
STATUS → STAGE EXACT FILES → REVIEW → COMMIT → PUSH
```

