# 16. Professional shell setup

The companion file:

```text
docs/lrs_shortcuts.sh
```

contains all variables, navigation aliases, and inspection helpers.

Add only this line to your `~/.bashrc`:

```bash
source "$HOME/lrs_benchmarking/docs/lrs_shortcuts.sh"
```

Then reload:

```bash
source ~/.bashrc
```

Why this is cleaner than putting dozens of project aliases directly into `.bashrc`:

```text
~/.bashrc
    → only activates the project navigation file

docs/lrs_shortcuts.sh
    → stores all LRS-specific navigation logic

docs/PROJECT_MAP.md
    → explains the architecture
```

This also means the map and shortcut definitions can be version-controlled together.

